{"entries":[{"id":"zhilinyang-2607.24653","sourceId":"zhilinyang","sourceName":"杨植麟","title":"Kimi K3: Open Frontier Intelligence","titleZh":"Kimi K3：开放前沿智能","published":"2026-07-27T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1785110400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zhilinyang-2607.24653/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/9d18fa6a5b91dc19.webp","summary":"Kimi K3, a 2.8T-parameter Mixture-of-Experts model with 104B activated parameters, native vision, and a 1M-token context, delivers 2.5x scaling efficiency gains and frontier-level performance across coding, agentic, knowledge, reasoning, and vision tasks while outperforming all other open models.","summaryZh":"Kimi K3 是一个拥有 2.8T 参数、104B 激活参数、原生视觉能力和 1M 上下文窗口的混合专家模型，其扩展效率较 K2 提升约 2.5 倍，在长程编码、智能体、知识、推理和视觉等任务上达到前沿水平，并超越所有其他开源模型。"},{"id":"zhilinyang-2602.02276","sourceId":"zhilinyang","sourceName":"杨植麟 · Moonshot AI","title":"Kimi K2.5: Visual Agentic Intelligence","titleZh":"Kimi K2.5：视觉智能体智能","published":"2026-02-02T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1769990400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zhilinyang-2602.02276/","image":"https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2602.02276/assets/figures/k25-main-result.png","summary":"Kimi K2.5 is an open-source multimodal agentic model achieving state-of-the-art results across coding, vision, reasoning, and agentic tasks, with a novel Agent Swarm framework reducing latency by up to 4.5x.","summaryZh":"Kimi K2.5 是一个开源多模态智能体模型，在编码、视觉、推理和智能体任务上达到最先进水平，其创新的 Agent Swarm 框架可将延迟降低多达 4.5 倍。"},{"id":"zhilinyang-2507.20534","sourceId":"zhilinyang","sourceName":"杨植麟 · Moonshot AI","title":"Kimi K2: Open Agentic Intelligence","titleZh":"Kimi K2：开放智能体智能","published":"2025-07-28T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1753660800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zhilinyang-2507.20534/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/6bbfafb7c2321840.webp","summary":"Kimi K2 achieves state-of-the-art performance among open-source non-thinking models, excelling in agentic tasks.","summaryZh":"Kimi K2 在开源非思考模型中达到最先进性能，尤其在智能体任务中表现出色。"},{"id":"zhilinyang-2504.18425","sourceId":"zhilinyang","sourceName":"杨植麟 · Moonshot AI","title":"Kimi-Audio Technical Report","titleZh":"Kimi-Audio 技术报告","published":"2025-04-25T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1745539200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zhilinyang-2504.18425/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/5d07a182c4514ced.webp","summary":"Kimi-Audio is an open-source audio foundation model achieving state-of-the-art performance in understanding, generation, and conversation.","summaryZh":"Kimi-Audio 是一个开源音频基础模型，在理解、生成和对话方面达到最先进水平。"},{"id":"zhilinyang-2504.07491","sourceId":"zhilinyang","sourceName":"杨植麟 · Moonshot AI","title":"Kimi-VL Technical Report","titleZh":"Kimi-VL 技术报告","published":"2025-04-10T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1744243200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zhilinyang-2504.07491/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/7981ca45899071c4.webp","summary":"Kimi-VL is an efficient open-source MoE vision-language model with only 2.8B activated parameters, achieving strong multimodal reasoning, long-context understanding, and agent capabilities, competing with GPT-4o-mini and surpassing GPT-4o in several domains.","summaryZh":"Kimi-VL 是一款高效开源 MoE 视觉语言模型，仅激活 2.8B 参数，具备强大的多模态推理、长上下文理解和智能体能力，可与 GPT-4o-mini 竞争，并在多个领域超越 GPT-4o。"},{"id":"zhilinyang-2502.13189","sourceId":"zhilinyang","sourceName":"杨植麟 · Moonshot AI","title":"MoBA: Mixture of Block Attention for Long-Context LLMs","titleZh":"MoBA：面向长上下文大语言模型的混合块注意力机制","published":"2025-02-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1739836800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zhilinyang-2502.13189/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/5bdcdd76035f6c6b.webp","summary":"MoBA applies Mixture of Experts to attention, enabling efficient long-context processing with seamless full-to-sparse attention transition.","summaryZh":"MoBA 将混合专家技术应用于注意力机制，实现了长上下文的高效处理，并能在全注意力和稀疏注意力之间无缝切换。"},{"id":"zhilinyang-2501.12599","sourceId":"zhilinyang","sourceName":"杨植麟 · Moonshot AI","title":"Kimi k1.5: Scaling Reinforcement Learning with LLMs","titleZh":"Kimi k1.5：通过强化学习扩展大语言模型","published":"2025-01-22T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1737504000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zhilinyang-2501.12599/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/b09316161afb266b.webp","summary":"Kimi k1.5 achieves state-of-the-art reasoning performance by scaling reinforcement learning with long context and improved policy optimization, matching OpenAI's o1.","summaryZh":"Kimi k1.5 通过长上下文和优化的策略方法扩展强化学习，在多项基准上达到与 OpenAI o1 相当的最优推理性能。"},{"id":"zhilinyang-1906.08237","sourceId":"zhilinyang","sourceName":"杨植麟 · CMU","title":"XLNet: Generalized Autoregressive Pretraining for Language Understanding","titleZh":"XLNet：面向语言理解的广义自回归预训练","published":"2019-06-19T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1560902400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zhilinyang-1906.08237/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/6ec1fda3f1865131.webp","summary":"XLNet outperforms BERT on 20 tasks by learning bidirectional contexts via permutation language modeling and integrating Transformer-XL.","summaryZh":"XLNet 通过排列语言建模学习双向上下文并集成 Transformer-XL，在 20 个任务上超越 BERT。"},{"id":"zhilinyang-1809.09600","sourceId":"zhilinyang","sourceName":"杨植麟 · Carnegie Mellon University / Stanford / MILA","title":"HotpotQA: A Dataset for Diverse, Explainable Multi-hop Question Answering","titleZh":"HotpotQA：一个多样化、可解释的多跳问答数据集","published":"2018-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1537833600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/zhilinyang-1809.09600/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/7cad9db421e77ab0.webp","summary":"HotpotQA is a new dataset with 113k Wikipedia-based QA pairs requiring multi-document reasoning and providing sentence-level supporting facts for explainable predictions.","summaryZh":"HotpotQA 是一个包含 11.3 万个基于维基百科的问答对的新数据集，要求进行多文档推理，并提供句子级别的支持事实以实现可解释的预测。"},{"id":"zhilinyang-1711.03953","sourceId":"zhilinyang","sourceName":"杨植麟 · Carnegie Mellon University","title":"Breaking the Softmax Bottleneck: A High-Rank RNN 